{
  "help": {
    "Agent": {
      "title": "Agent",
      "body": "Here you read what the agent did: every conversation with every step, in words.\n\nThe agent records each write as a proposal instead of posting it. You decide it in Attention, one line per proposal; the full list is also here under Proposals. There you tick several and approve or reject them together; rejecting asks nothing. Under Permissions you set how far each kind of action is trusted, from always ask to run automatically.\n\nThat grant is yours alone to give: no agent can raise its own trust.",
      "concepts": [],
      "docsPath": "introduction"
    }
  },
